# Images are LFS. A 2048x2048 icon per Operator adds up in a repo that never
# deletes a version.
#
# This only works because every URL in the Item Store catalog points at
# media.githubusercontent.com/media/, which resolves LFS content.
# raw.githubusercontent.com serves an LFS-tracked path as a ~130 byte pointer
# file instead of the image, and does it with a 200, so an icon URL on the raw
# host would look fine and render nothing.
*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
